From: Jarvis2 OS developers <jarvis2@example.invalid>
Subject: [PATCH] adbd: respect explicit disabled Android TCP port without USB

Base-commit: 8f1f33d623ca6cffd6c415b43b317fd274660601
Source-project: packages/modules/adb

A stock vendor can enable TCP debugging. Product's explicit disabled port
must remain disabled even if the USB endpoint is absent. Preserve positive
port parsing, unset-property fallback and host adbd behavior. Register the
same policy tests in existing host adb_test and device adbd_test modules.

